  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie ali nyang’ i kind ot pa Saul ku ot pa Daudi: e Daudi cikudoko tek m’usagu, ento ot pa Saul ucikudoko ng’ic m’usagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man junyolo nyithindho ma co ni Daudi i Hebron: man kayu pare en e Amnon, ma kor Ahinoam ma Nyayezreli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man pare mir arionde Kileab, ma kor Abigail ma naka dhaku pa Nabal ma Jakarmeli; man mir adege, Absalom ma wod Maka ma nya Talmai m’ubimo mi Gecur; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man mir ang’wende, Adonija ma wod Hagith; man mir abije, Cefatia ma wod Abital; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man mir abusiende, Ithream, ma kor Egla, ma dhaku pa Daudi. Junyolo maeni ni Daudi i Hebron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde m’ali ni kind ot pa Saul ku ot pa Daudi, nia Abner udwokre gire tek i ot pa Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u dhaku pa Saul m’araga nuti ma nyinge Rizpa, ma nyar Aia, man Ic-boceth uwacu ni Abner kumae, Pirang’o imondo wi dhaku pa vwa m’araga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kwinyo ma dit ulund unego Abner kum lembe pa Ic-boceth, man ewacu kumae, An a wi gwoki ma piny pa Yuda? Tinuni anyutho bero kum ot pa Saul ma wuru, kum utumin mire, man kum jurimbe, man amii ngo i cing’ Daudi; ento iting’o lembe i kuma i ceng’ maeni pi dhaku maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu tim kumeni kum Abner, man mange bende, tek, calu Yehova kwong’o ni Daudi, tek atimo cil kumeca ngo i bang’e; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya alok ker kud i ot pa Saul, man ating’ komker pa Daudi wi Israel man wi Yuda, ugambre Dan cil kum Ber-ceba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ecopo loko lembe ngo kendo bang’ Abner, kum lworo nege i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Abner uoro jukwenda ba Daudi pire, ewacu kumae, Ng’om en e pa ng’a? ewacu kumae bende, Watim lembariba wakudi, man, nen, cinga bibedo karacelo kudi, kara ukel Israel ceke i beng’i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Ber; wabitimo lembariba wakudi; ento gin acel alwong’o i beng’i: en e maeni, ibineno wang’a ngo, tek k’ilar ikelo Mikal ma nya Saul ungo, kan ibino neno wang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi oro jukwenda ba Ic-boceth, ma wod Saul, ewacu kumae, Mi ira dhaku para Mikal, m’anyomo ira ku dendkum m’i kendi mi Jufilisti dak acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ic-boceth uoro, man egame ku ba cware, en e ba Paltiel ma wod Laie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E cware gicidho gikude, m’ewotho ku ywak, man elubo toke cil ba Bahurim. Abner ulund uwacu ire kumae, Cidhi, doki: e edok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Abner giweco ku judongo mir Israel, giwacu kumae, I nindo m’ukadhu wuyenyo Daudi ubed ubimo i wiwu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e dong’ wutime; kum Yehova yero pi Daudi, ewacu kumae, Ku cing’ Daudi ma jatic para, abibodho dhanu para ma Israel kud i cing’ Jufilisti, man kud i cing’ judegi migi ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Abner uyero i ith Benyamin bende: e Abner ucidho kara eyer i ith Daudi bende i Hebron gin ceke m’ubedo ber i wang’ Israel, man ni ot ceke pa Benyamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Abner ubino ba Daudi i Hebron, giku dhanu pier ario. Man Daudi timo agba ni Abner ku dhanu ma gini karacelo kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Abner uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Abiai abicidho, man abicoko Israel ceke ba rwoth para m’ubimo, kara wutim lembariba wukugi, man kara ibim wi dhanu ceke ma ng’eyongec peri yenyo. Man Daudi ciko Abner; e ecidho ma cwinye kwio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man, nen, jutic pa Daudi ku pa Yoab ma giai i kind udul, e gibino kud ayeki ma dit: ento A’oner ni karacelo ku Daudi ngo i Hebron: kum ecike, man ecidho ma cwinye kwio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde ma Yoab kud udul ceke ma gini kude giwok, e giyero ni Yoab, giwacu kumae, Abner ma wod Ner ubino bang’ ubimo, e ecike, man ecidho ma cwinye kwio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoab ulund ubino bang’ ubimo, man ewacu kumae, Itimo ang’o? nen, Abner ubino i beng’i; nedi icike, man ecidho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing’eyo Abner ma wod Ner, nia ebino kara ebombi, man kara eng’ei wok woko peri ku mondo peri, man kara eng’ei gin ceke m’itimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka Yoab uai ku ba Daudi, eoro jukwenda tok Abner, man gijige ku ba pi m’atong’a mi Sira: ento Daudi ng’eyo ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
