            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde ma Abner udwogo Hebron, Yoab ucoro kude cen i kind dhugang’ kara giwec kude ling’ ling’, e egoye keca i kume, ketho etho, pi rimb Asahel m’umin mire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man yo ku ng’eye, ka Daudi winjo pire, ewacu kumae, Waku ker para lembe mbe i wiwa i wang’ Yehova pi rimb Abner ma wod Ner: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek epodh wi Yoab, man wi ot pa won ceke; man ng’atu moko kud ubed umbe i ot pa Yoab ma won tho ma kasinono, kadi ma won joi, kadi ma komo kud uluth, kadi ma podho ku palamularu, kadi ma can cam unege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yoab kud Abicai m’umin mire ginego Abner, kum enego umeggi ma Asahel i Gibeon i lwiny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
